menu "e32p: mqtt"

    config E32P_MQTT_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_mqtt (MQTT v3.1.1 client)"
        default n
        help
            MQTT client facade over ESP-IDF's esp-mqtt: client lifecycle,
            publish/subscribe, connection state, and a compact event callback.
            The MQTT topic-filter matching (+/# wildcards, $-topic rule) is a pure
            function and is unit-tested headless; the network path needs Wi-Fi (or
            another netif) and a broker. Does not select a transport — the
            application provides connectivity (e.g. e32p_wifi).

endmenu
